Netskope DLP On Demand — Databricks Unity AI Gateway Adapter
Copyright 2026 Netskope, Inc.

This repository's CloudFormation template (templates/databricks-adapter.yaml)
and documentation are original work, built to bridge the Databricks Unity AI
Gateway "External Policy Direct HTTP API" and the Netskope DLP On Demand
(DLPoD) sync content inspection REST API. It is not derived from any
third-party reference architecture.

This repo does not include a Netskope DLPoD appliance deployment — it
assumes one is already deployed and tethered to your Netskope tenant. It
pairs with the sibling repo
[databricks-plugin-netskope-ai-guardrail](https://github.com/sandiegojenkins/databricks-plugin-netskope-ai-guardrail),
which does include a full appliance deployment (for the separate AI
Guardrails on Demand product) and whose Guardrails CloudFormation template
is derived from
[jharris-ns/AWS-AIGW-Reference-Architecture](https://github.com/jharris-ns/AWS-AIGW-Reference-Architecture)
(Apache-2.0) — that attribution does not apply to this repo.

